<title>USA: Grease Monkey Holding Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Grease Monkey Holding Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter Ended</p>
<p>							     March 31,</p>
<p>							1997	    1996</p>
<p> Revenue				    $4,952,647     $4,633,189</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)			 (476,945)	(122,040)</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss) Per Share		 (.11)	    (.04)</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>						 4,537,823	4,344,959</p>
<p>NOTE:  Grease Monkey Holdings Corp said its net loss for the first quarter of 1997 includes a one-time charge of $379,000 for the accrual of all expenses related to the fulfillment of a two- year consulting agreement the company has entered into with Rex Utsler, former Chairman, President and Chief Executive Officer.</p>
